# Tiger inner model-required v1/v2 profiles only; this template is not loaded automatically.
# Put actual credentials in a protected operator-owned file outside the checkout,
# then export these four variables in the trusted CLI/MCP startup environment.
# Official alias mapping observed 2026-10-27: DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017.
# deepseek-flash is an alias, not an immutable versioned model identifier.
LLM_BACKEND=api
LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com
LLM_MODEL=deepseek-flash
LLM_API_KEY=
# Native Search uses the same provider/key at /v1/tools/search. V2 adds bounded
# issuer searches and model-requested /v1/tools/fetch after 14 broad topics.
# The v1 historical collector remains unchanged; missing Fetch dates stay unknown.
# Each v2 task admits budget before I/O: chat 40, tokens 300000, Search 60,
# Fetch 20, remote requests 120, conservative USD 1 estimate, deadline 2400s.
# No local/mock/disabled/passthrough or alternate-model fallback is allowed.
